326 0 obj
<<
/Title (The roadmap goes from basics to projects, then to connecting and scripting, then AI skills, and finally specialisation. The course experiments on building an appointment-style application, workflows and pro-code extension fall mainly in steps two and three.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 239 0 R
/Next 428 0 R
>>
endobj
327 0 obj
<<
/Title (3.9 Likely future workflow)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 239 0 R
/Prev 428 0 R
/First 429 0 R
/Last 430 0 R
